Today is Saturday afternoon.
I am in the kitchen of my flat.
I am making food from my home country today.
I am preparing salsa and a spicy bean dish.
I had bought the vegetables for this yesterday.
I take the tomatoes, onions, and green chilies.
I wash and clean them well.
I cut them into small pieces to make salsa.
Then, I start cooking the beans.
I add some spices to it.
The kitchen now smells like my house in Mexico.
That smell is very familiar to me.
I spend about an hour in the kitchen.
Now the food is ready.
Anitha is coming here to eat dinner tonight.
I think she will like this food.
